    news: "Three ships have gone onto the rocks below Pale Cove this winter, each on a night when the Salt Lamp, down the coast, was shut by fog. The Concord’s coast-guard says the cove showed a false lamp. The cove says it did not. Granny Gull, who mends nets for all of them, says half of them did and half of them did not, and that nobody knows which.",
