      ground: "The lieutenant writes in her report that the cove is not proven guilty and not proven innocent, and that the Salt Lamp’s log will be read in spring. The wrecks stop. The coast-guard cutter lies off the cove for a season, and the cove sits in the loft in the evenings with the lamp out.",
