    news: "The pans at Grey Strand are fed from one brine channel, and two families keep them: the Gaos and the Tans. For three generations they shared the water by the sluice-board. This spring the board rotted, and each family says the hours were theirs. A pan-boy called Xiao Er, who is a Tan on his mother’s side and a Gao on his father’s, has been sent to carry messages and is sick of them.",
